{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645860/extras/annihilator_manual.jpg?t=1744263714\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The year is 40XX. Eden Try: a city powered by pain. Buildings, lights, street signs, vending machines\u2014all run on the agony of those unfortunate to endure Tribulation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645860/extras/New_Project__4_.jpg?t=1744263714\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pioneered by CRUSH, Tribulation transforms human suffering into fuel for war machines and enhanced soldiers. Victims\u2019 torsos, vital organs, and brains are fused with machines designed to extract raw emotion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645860/extras/annihilator_manual__10_.jpg?t=1744263714\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Locked in a perpetual loop of death and revival, they relive their final moments endlessly. Fear, hate, hope\u2014all harvested through torture to power the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But by miracle or chance, One has escaped hell and death followed him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645860/extras/annihilator_manual__7_.jpg?t=1744263714\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You play as Shinryu, after regaining consciousness. Taken as a trophy and placed in an Annihilator suit, forced to do the bidding of a psychopath CEO. You seek revenge for the pain caused to your family.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645860/extras/New_Project__3_.jpg?t=1744263714\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Origin</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645860/extras/New_Project__1_.jpg?t=1744263714\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Annihilator is a gritty top-down shooter, originally made for the Game Boy Color. This is a modern 1:1 adaption, where I've converted the original GBC graphics into a 3D environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game's design is based around the original limitations with tweaks to make it feel better for modern play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> You'll fight your way through various facilities - facing cyborgs and mutants to take down a corporate war machine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645860/extras/annihilator_manual__3_.jpg?t=1744263714\" /><br></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3645860?t=1744263714","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645860/44b47f9db4a75b6c8537c85902a23faebd8b6ac9/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744263714","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645860/d27baf1a010ae500a580c5206663cff9b958eeec/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744263714","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645860/d27baf1a010ae500a580c5206663cff9b958eeec/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744263714","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"The background themes and story of the game contain slavery and torture of fictional characters. The player will not participate in these actions.\r\n\r\nDepictions of violence are cartoony and pixelated."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645860/extras/annihilator_manual.jpg?t=1744263714\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The year is 40XX. Eden Try: a city powered by pain. Buildings, lights, street signs, vending machines\u2014all run on the agony of those unfortunate to endure Tribulation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645860/extras/New_Project__4_.jpg?t=1744263714\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pioneered by CRUSH, Tribulation transforms human suffering into fuel for war machines and enhanced soldiers. Victims\u2019 torsos, vital organs, and brains are fused with machines designed to extract raw emotion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645860/extras/annihilator_manual__10_.jpg?t=1744263714\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Locked in a perpetual loop of death and revival, they relive their final moments endlessly. Fear, hate, hope\u2014all harvested through torture to power the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But by miracle or chance, One has escaped hell and death followed him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645860/extras/annihilator_manual__7_.jpg?t=1744263714\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You play as Shinryu, after regaining consciousness. Taken as a trophy and placed in an Annihilator suit, forced to do the bidding of a psychopath CEO. You seek revenge for the pain caused to your family.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645860/extras/New_Project__3_.jpg?t=1744263714\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Origin</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645860/extras/New_Project__1_.jpg?t=1744263714\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Annihilator is a gritty top-down shooter, originally made for the Game Boy Color. This is a modern 1:1 adaption, where I've converted the original GBC graphics into a 3D environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game's design is based around the original limitations with tweaks to make it feel better for modern play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> You'll fight your way through various facilities - facing cyborgs and mutants to take down a corporate war machine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645860/extras/annihilator_manual__3_.jpg?t=1744263714\" /><br></p>","developers":["Salt & Pixel LLC"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645860/40a79936b3eb220d17c3f5b78f9151616734e827/header.jpg?t=1744263714","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257122346,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257122346/movie480.mp4?t=1744263712","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257122346/movie_max.mp4?t=1744263712"},"name":"Gameplay_trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257122346/d88546db8264081d6093bd32656c81e38a26cb0b/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1744263712","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257122346/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1744263712","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257122346/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1744263712"}}],"name":"ANNIHILATOR","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Win 10<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 MB RAM</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"window